<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '34px 72px 22px 72px', background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Noto Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 84, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', paddingBottom: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 14 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3730A3', fontFamily: "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace" }}>02</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2430', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>四层同一个模型：工作单元从一条消息到一整个目标</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 544, paddingTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>

        <Box style={{ width: 700, height: '100%', background: '#F6F7FB', borderRadius: 16 }}>
            <svg width={700} height={520} viewBox='0 0 700 520' style={{ marginTop: 2 }}>
                <rect x='60' y='35' width='580' height='450' rx='30' fill='none' stroke='#3730A3' strokeWidth='1' opacity='0.22' />
                <rect x='125' y='85' width='450' height='350' rx='26' fill='none' stroke='#3730A3' strokeWidth='1' opacity='0.36' />
                <rect x='190' y='135' width='320' height='250' rx='22' fill='none' stroke='#3730A3' strokeWidth='1' opacity='0.52' />
                <rect x='260' y='185' width='180' height='150' rx='18' fill='#EEEDFE' opacity='0.85' stroke='#3730A3' strokeWidth='1' />
                <rect x='305' y='228' width='90' height='64' rx='12' fill='#0EA5E9' />
                <text x='350' y='267' fontSize='17' fontWeight='bold' fill='#FFFFFF' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='sans-serif'>Model</text>

                <text x='74' y='60' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold' fill='#3730A3'>Loop<tspan fontSize='13' fontWeight='normal' fill='#6B7280'> · 一个目标的生命周期</tspan></text>
                <text x='139' y='110' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold' fill='#3730A3'>Harness<tspan fontSize='13' fontWeight='normal' fill='#6B7280'> · 一次运行</tspan></text>
                <text x='204' y='160' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold' fill='#3730A3'>Context<tspan fontSize='13' fontWeight='normal' fill='#6B7280'> · 一轮窗口</tspan></text>
                <text x='272' y='210' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold' fill='#3730A3'>Prompt<tspan fontSize='13' fontWeight='normal' fill='#6B7280'> · 一条消息</tspan></text>

                <text x='74' y='466' fontSize='13' fill='#6B7280'>层与层不替代：外层管更长的时间尺度，内层管更细的执行细节。</text>
            </svg>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: '100%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2430' }}>症状落在哪一层，就去修哪一层</Text>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, marginTop: 16 }}>
                <Box style={{ height: 68, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0px 16px', background: '#F6F7FB', borderRadius: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1F2430', width: 220 }}>输出格式漂移、字段对不上</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3730A3', fontFamily: "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace" }}>Prompt</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 68, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0px 16px', background: '#F6F7FB', borderRadius: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1F2430', width: 220 }}>答得挺顺，但证据缺失、无出处</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3730A3', fontFamily: "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace" }}>Context</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 68, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0px 16px', background: '#F6F7FB', borderRadius: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1F2430', width: 220 }}>动作不安全、重复触发、没回执</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3730A3', fontFamily: "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace" }}>Harness</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 68, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0px 16px', background: '#EEEDFE', borderRadius: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1F2430', width: 220 }}>反复空转、或过早宣布完成</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0EA5E9', fontFamily: "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace" }}>Loop</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', background: '#EEEDFE', borderLeft: '3px solid #0EA5E9', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1F2430', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>先问「哪个契约是假的」，再问「该改哪句提示词」。顺序反了，就会用改措辞的办法去修一个根本不在措辞层的问题。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 36, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6B7280' }}>认知副驾 · 周技术汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6B7280', fontFamily: "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace" }}>06 / 16</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
